  "title": "Spicy Beef Bulgogi",
  "description": "Flank steak is marinated in a fiery soy sauce and sesame marinade then grilled until slightly charred in this spicy take on Beef Bulgogi.",
  "authors": [
    "Joel Sticha"
  ],
